const CONS = 'HL7 C-CDA IG (hl7.org/cda/us/ccda): C-CDA harmonized prior guides from the HL7 Health Story project, IHE, HITSP C32 and the original CCD within ONC\'s S&I Framework. No source located for the count "seven" (searched); count dropped.';
